20:52.599 --> 20:53.680
Encik Qu.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.680
Encik Qu.

20:54.799 --> 20:57.839
Tadi tu loghat London yang “kelas” ya?

21:00.079 --> 21:00.759
Kau tahu,

21:01.440 --> 21:03.759
