27:51.799 --> 27:53.160
Cepat, cepat, bagi sini tengok

27:53.559 --> 27:54.599
Jangan makan dulu

27:56.400 --> 27:58.240
Bagi sini, tengok... banyaknya duit

27:58.240 --> 27:58.920
Bagi saya tengok

28:00.119 --> 28:01.160
Alamak, Xiaojue

28:01.279 --> 28:01.799
Ya

28:01.799 --> 28:02.640
Awak kata duit awak sendiri

28:02.640 --> 28:03.519
